================================================================================
Data sources (no HTTP in the view; ADR-002):
  useVehicles + useSafety -> SafetyFeaturesSource over the shared VehiclesStore (S8) / VehiclesRepository (S7)
    and VehicleSystemsStore.safety / VehicleSystemsRepository.safety cache-then-network seam; latest safety is
    the raw JsonElement the shared layer serves for /safety/latest. vehicle-id resolution reproduces
    `vehicleId ?? vehicles?.[0]?.id ?? 0` (positive prop id wins, else first enrolled, else empty surface).
Cells reproduced verbatim from web `buildCells` (8, in order): fcw, aeb, lda, elda, bsc, bscw, slw, cfd.
  - cleanSafetyEnum / isSafetyEnumActive ported from web lib/safetyEnum.ts (the SINGLE choke point that never
    coerces a non-string): boolean -> On/Off; finite number -> JS decimal (3.0 -> "3"); typed/codec-stripped
    string -> field-prefix stripped; SpeedAssistLevelNone -> "Off"; inactive token set {off,none,disabled,0}.
    typeof guards match web typeGuards.ts (only a native bool is a bool, only a native finite number a number,
    only a quoted non-empty string a string).
  - aeb uses the inverted "off"-flag (true -> Disabled/inactive); elda/bsc/bscw are plain toggles
    (true -> Enabled/ok); null -> em dash / unknown. activeCount = cells with status ok.
States (all rendered; none hidden): loading (full skeleton, no header — web WidgetShell loading short-circuit);
  hard error (ErrorDisplay + Retry — web WidgetShell `error` -> QueryError); content compact (cols<=1: big
  active-count + "Active Features"); content full (status grid, cols = size.cols>=3 ? 4 : 2, each cell a
  status-tinted bordered box + corner dot + label + normalized value); empty ("No safety data" when the
  snapshot is falsy); stale/offline (cached grid stays visible with the header freshness chip flagged).
Registry (web registry/security.ts): id "safety-features", category "security", default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40
  (SafetyFeaturesRegistration; unit-tested isWithinBounds/clamp + gridColumns + isCompact).
i18n (P1/S10; every key already present in app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml):
  translation_widget_safety_{fcw,aeb,lda,elda,bsc,bscw,slw,cfd,enabled,disabled,title,activeFeatures,noData},
  translation_common_{refresh,loading,retry,offline}, translation_a11y_loading,
  translation_error_serverError_{title,message}, translation_freshness_{justNow,seconds,minutes,hours,days,weeks}.
  (cleanSafetyEnum's "On"/"Off" and the prefix-stripped enum suffixes are data-normalization outputs the web
  hardcodes verbatim — reproduced for observable parity, NOT UI chrome labels; same precedent as GuardMode's
